WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.479 --> 00:00:02.515
THE DEMOCRATIC PRESIDENT IS

00:00:02.314 --> 00:00:04.650
MISSING.

00:00:02.648 --> 00:00:08.888
AND SO ARE HIS VOTERS.

00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:10.956
AND THAT IS THE ANGLE.

00:00:09.021 --> 00:00:13.959
IF CLINTON GOT THAT UPSET

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:14.693
DISCUSSING LEWINSKY, IMAGINE

00:00:14.093 --> 00:00:16.695
"THE TODAY SHOW" HAD ASKED ABOUT

00:00:14.827 --> 00:00:20.299
THE WOMEN WHO TOLD HIM NO.

00:00:16.829 --> 00:00:22.101
JOINING US NOW ARE KATHLEEN

00:00:20.432 --> 00:00:23.202
WILLEY AND JUANITA BROADDRICK,

00:00:22.234 --> 00:00:26.238
AUTHOR OF THE NEW BOOK "YOU

00:00:23.335 --> 00:00:30.142
BETTER PUT SOME ICE ON THAT: HOW

00:00:26.372 --> 00:00:30.776
I SURVIVED BEING RAPED BY

00:00:30.276 --> 00:00:31.777
BILL CLINTON."

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:34.847
I'VE BEEN THINKING ABOUT YOU ALL

00:00:31.911 --> 00:00:37.283
DAY, AND ALSO, PAULA.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.550
JUANITA, I WANT TO START WITH

00:00:37.416 --> 00:00:39.618
YOU.

00:00:37.683 --> 00:00:43.789
BILL CLINTON DID APPROACH YOU,

00:00:39.752 --> 00:00:44.156
DID HE NOT, IN 1992, TO

00:00:43.923 --> 00:00:46.559
APOLOGIZE?

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:47.326
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:00:46.692 --> 00:00:47.726
YES.

00:00:47.459 --> 00:00:49.061
HE DID.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:50.930
IT WAS IN 1991.

00:00:49.194 --> 00:00:53.699
I WAS IN LITTLE ROCK AT A

00:00:51.063 --> 00:00:55.000
NURSING HOME SEMINAR AND SOMEONE

00:00:53.832 --> 00:00:56.068
COMES TO THE DOOR AND SAYS, I

00:00:55.134 --> 00:01:00.472
WANTED IN THE HALLWAY.

00:00:56.201 --> 00:01:01.240
I GO OUT AND THE MAN POINTS DOWN

00:01:00.606 --> 00:01:02.508
AROUND THE CORNER BY THE

00:01:01.373 --> 00:01:03.208
ELEVATOR.

00:01:02.641 --> 00:01:07.146
AND SO I GO DOWN THERE.

00:01:03.342 --> 00:01:07.913
AS I ROUND THE CORNER, THERE

00:01:07.279 --> 00:01:08.614
STANDS BILL CLINTON WITH TWO OF

00:01:08.047 --> 00:01:10.115
HIS ARKANSAS STATE POLICE

00:01:08.747 --> 00:01:13.652
GUARDS.

00:01:10.249 --> 00:01:16.956
AND HE RUSHES OVER TO ME AND HE

00:01:13.786 --> 00:01:18.958
STARTS THIS PROFUSE APOLOGY AND

00:01:17.089 --> 00:01:20.726
SAYING, I'M SO SORRY FOR WHAT I

00:01:19.091 --> 00:01:23.128
DID, I AM A CHANGED MAN.

00:01:20.859 --> 00:01:23.529
I'M JUST NOT THE MAN I USED TO

00:01:23.262 --> 00:01:25.931
BE.

00:01:23.662 --> 00:01:29.134
EVEN SAID, I'M A FAMILY MAN NOW.

00:01:26.065 --> 00:01:31.570
AND I JUST LOOKED AT HIM, LAURA,

00:01:29.268 --> 00:01:32.004
AND I -- I WAS JUST

00:01:31.704 --> 00:01:35.541
FLABBERGASTED.

00:01:32.137 --> 00:01:36.108
I SAID, YOU GO TO HELL.

00:01:35.674 --> 00:01:37.776
I WALKED OFF.

00:01:36.241 --> 00:01:39.578
I COULD NOT BELIEVE IT.

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:41.380
AND THE NURSES WHO WERE WITH ME

00:01:39.712 --> 00:01:43.182
FOLLOWED ME OUT.

00:01:41.513 --> 00:01:44.950
AND THEY CAME OVER TO ME AND

00:01:43.315 --> 00:01:46.752
THEY SAID, WHAT DID HE WANT?

00:01:45.084 --> 00:01:48.754
AND I TOLD THEM.

00:01:46.885 --> 00:01:49.922
AND THEN I BEGAN TO FEEL A

00:01:48.887 --> 00:01:53.225
LITTLE BAD THAT I HAD SAID THAT,

00:01:50.055 --> 00:01:55.327
I KEPT THINKING, WELL, MAYBE HE

00:01:53.359 --> 00:01:55.928
REALLY MEANT THAT, MAYBE HE

00:01:55.461 --> 00:01:57.229
REALLY WAS APOLOGIZING.

00:01:56.061 --> 00:02:00.132
&gt;&gt; Laura: THEN WHAT HAPPENED?

00:01:57.363 --> 00:02:01.500
THEN YOU REALIZED...

00:02:00.265 --> 00:02:02.635
FAST-FORWARD, HE WAS RUNNING FOR

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:05.571
PRESIDENT AND YOU WERE PERHAPS

00:02:02.768 --> 00:02:05.237
GOING TO BE AN OBSTACLE FOR THAT

00:02:05.237 --> 00:02:05.904
GOING TO BE AN OBSTACLE FOR THA

00:02:05.704 --> 00:02:06.639
THAT?

00:02:06.038 --> 00:02:08.340
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:02:06.772 --> 00:02:11.510
THAT'S EXACTLY IT -- A WEAK

00:02:08.474 --> 00:02:13.946
LEADER AFTER HE APOLOGIZED,

00:02:11.644 --> 00:02:15.547
HE RESPONDED HE WAS RUNNING FOR

00:02:14.079 --> 00:02:16.248
PRESIDENT.

00:02:15.681 --> 00:02:18.217
&gt;&gt; Laura: A WEEK LATER

00:02:16.382 --> 00:02:18.550
QUESTION MIKE THAT'S REALLY

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:21.387
SUBTLE.

00:02:18.684 --> 00:02:21.920
KATHLEEN WILEY, YOU WATCH THAT

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.355
INTERVIEW.

00:02:22.054 --> 00:02:24.123
I'VE GOT TO SAY, I'M ALWAYS DONE

00:02:23.489 --> 00:02:24.657
THAT.

00:02:24.256 --> 00:02:27.626
WHY AM I STUNNED?

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:29.662
HE HAS NOT LEARNED ANYTHING

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:32.731
ABOUT THIS EXPERIENCE.

00:02:29.795 --> 00:02:33.298
HE'S ACTUALLY A SMART GUY.

00:02:32.865 --> 00:02:35.734
I'M ALMOST SPEECHLESS.

00:02:33.432 --> 00:02:37.336
YOUR REACTION?

00:02:35.868 --> 00:02:38.337
&gt;&gt; I'M SPEECHLESS TOO.

00:02:37.469 --> 00:02:39.405
I WAS OUTRAGED.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.639
I COULD NOT BELIEVE THE WORDS

00:02:39.538 --> 00:02:40.939
THAT WERE COMING OUT OF HIS

00:02:40.773 --> 00:02:44.043
MOUTH.

00:02:41.073 --> 00:02:47.146
HE WAS SO ARROGANT AND POMPOUS

00:02:44.176 --> 00:02:48.480
ABOUT THE WHOLE THING.

00:02:47.279 --> 00:02:49.481
I THINK HE ACTUALLY DOES BELIEVE

00:02:48.614 --> 00:02:51.650
THAT HE DIDN'T DO ANYTHING

00:02:49.615 --> 00:02:57.322
WRONG.

00:02:51.784 --> 00:02:58.624
AND JUST A BLANKET APOLOGY.

00:02:57.623 --> 00:02:59.091
HE HAS APOLOGIZE TO PEOPLE THAT

00:02:58.757 --> 00:03:01.694
HE WORKED WITH.

00:02:59.224 --> 00:03:03.729
AND THE PEOPLE HE DESTROYED, THE

00:03:01.827 --> 00:03:05.064
WOMEN HE DESTROYED, HE HAS

00:03:03.862 --> 00:03:08.934
APOLOGIZED TO ME, HE HAS NOT

00:03:05.197 --> 00:03:11.937
APOLOGIZED TO PAULA, HE

00:03:09.068 --> 00:03:13.972
APOLOGIZED TO JUANITA, BUT THERE

00:03:12.071 --> 00:03:16.341
WAS A PURPOSE FOR THAT.

00:03:14.106 --> 00:03:18.644
AND HE HASN'T APOLOGIZED TO

00:03:16.475 --> 00:03:19.778
LESLIE OR NUMEROUS OTHER WOMEN

00:03:18.777 --> 00:03:21.146
WHO HAVE COME FORWARD AND SAY

00:03:19.912 --> 00:03:21.580
THEY TOLD STORIES ABOUT HIM.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.582
HE NEVER WILL.

00:03:21.714 --> 00:03:25.384
HE DOESN'T GET IT.

00:03:23.716 --> 00:03:27.152
JUST THE WAY IT IS.

00:03:25.517 --> 00:03:29.621
&gt;&gt; Laura: HE SEEMS TO THINK --

00:03:27.286 --> 00:03:32.357
HE HANDLED IT WELL.

00:03:29.755 --> 00:03:33.025
TO WATCH THAT INTERVIEW, HE

00:03:32.491 --> 00:03:35.928
DIDN'T SAY HE WOULD'VE DONE

00:03:33.158 --> 00:03:36.729
ANYTHING DIFFERENTLY.

00:03:36.061 --> 00:03:37.529
EVERYBODY MAKES MISTAKES IN

00:03:36.862 --> 00:03:39.498
THEIR LIFE.

00:03:37.663 --> 00:03:39.798
COULD HAVE, SHOULD HAVE, WOULD

00:03:39.631 --> 00:03:43.335
HAVE.

00:03:39.932 --> 00:03:44.903
LORD KNOWS WE ALL DO.

00:03:43.469 --> 00:03:47.139
BUT 20 YEARS LATER TO SAY, YOU

00:03:45.037 --> 00:03:48.006
KNOW, I WISH I COULD TURN BACK

00:03:47.272 --> 00:03:49.908
THE CLOCK AND, YOU KNOW, SHOW

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:52.745
BETTER JUDGMENT.

00:03:50.042 --> 00:03:53.145
BUT, I MEAN -- I DO THAT 50

00:03:52.878 --> 00:03:54.613
TIMES A DAY.

00:03:53.278 --> 00:03:59.918
"WHY DID I DO THAT" -- IT'S A

00:03:54.747 --> 00:04:02.521
LITTLE STRANGE.

00:04:00.052 --> 00:04:03.255
ON CNN, OFFERED SOMEWHAT TEPID

00:04:02.654 --> 00:04:05.958
CRITIQUE OF THIS PERFORMANCE.

00:04:03.388 --> 00:04:07.893
LET'S WATCH.

00:04:06.091 --> 00:04:09.895
&gt;&gt; THERE COULD HAVE BEEN A MORE

00:04:08.026 --> 00:04:10.729
PRACTICE ANSWER, OR ONE, I WOULD

00:04:10.028 --> 00:04:11.663
THINK, ALLUDED TO THE NOTION

00:04:10.863 --> 00:04:14.133
THAT THERE WAS A CHANGE IN THE

00:04:11.797 --> 00:04:15.000
PAST 20 YEARS.

00:04:14.266 --> 00:04:16.201
OBVIOUSLY, THE RULES WERE

00:04:15.134 --> 00:04:17.136
DIFFERENT AND HE WOULD'VE DONE

00:04:16.335 --> 00:04:17.770
SOMETHING DIFFERENTLY TODAY OR

00:04:17.269 --> 00:04:20.506
HE WOULD SAY SOMETHING

00:04:17.903 --> 00:04:21.673
DIFFERENTLY ABOUT IT TODAY.

00:04:20.639 --> 00:04:27.713
&gt;&gt; Laura: HE COULD HAVE HAD A

00:04:21.807 --> 00:04:28.046
MORE PRACTICE ANSWER.

00:04:27.846 --> 00:04:29.148
JUANITA.

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:30.482
&gt;&gt; MY GOD...

00:04:29.281 --> 00:04:31.917
BE WHEN HE COULD'VE ALSO NOT

00:04:30.616 --> 00:04:34.319
PORTRAYED HIMSELF AS A VICTIM.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.753
HOW DOES HE BECOME THE VICTIM IN

00:04:34.453 --> 00:04:35.721
ALL OF THIS?

00:04:34.887 --> 00:04:36.054
&gt;&gt; I KNOW!

00:04:35.854 --> 00:04:39.124
I KNOW.

00:04:36.188 --> 00:04:41.660
I SAW THIS DECREPIT, ANGRY OLD

00:04:39.258 --> 00:04:43.695
MAN WHO WAS TRYING TO PLAY THE

00:04:41.794 --> 00:04:47.466
VICTIM CARD.

00:04:43.829 --> 00:04:48.100
THE SAME MAN WHO 40 YEARS AGO

00:04:47.599 --> 00:04:51.670
RAPED ME.

00:04:48.233 --> 00:04:52.871
IT WAS DISGUSTING.

00:04:51.804 --> 00:04:56.108
&gt;&gt; Laura: KATHLEEN, IT

00:04:53.005 --> 00:04:58.043
WOULD'VE BEEN REALLY AMAZING --

00:04:56.241 --> 00:04:58.911
I AM SHOCKED THAT MELVIN ASKED

00:04:58.177 --> 00:05:00.913
THESE QUESTIONS.

00:04:59.044 --> 00:05:02.014
&gt;&gt; I AM TOO.

00:05:01.046 --> 00:05:03.582
&gt;&gt; Laura: IT WOULD'VE BEEN

00:05:02.147 --> 00:05:07.085
REALLY AMAZING IF HE ASKED ABOUT

00:05:03.715 --> 00:05:07.753
WANITA, YOU, THE OTHERS, BUT HE

00:05:07.219 --> 00:05:10.088
FOCUSED ON MONICA WILENSKY

00:05:07.886 --> 00:05:09.655
BECAUSE THAT WAS THE IMPEACHMENT

00:05:09.655 --> 00:05:11.356
BECAUSE THAT WAS THE IMPEACHMEN.

00:05:10.222 --> 00:05:14.927
EVEN JOE LOCKHART -- LET'S PLAY

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:15.694
THIS QUICKLY.

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:16.361
JOE LOCKHART, FORMER WHITE HOUSE

00:05:15.828 --> 00:05:16.728
PRESS SECRETARY SAID THAT

00:05:16.495 --> 00:05:20.699
YESTERDAY.

00:05:16.862 --> 00:05:21.433
LET'S WATCH.

00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:23.535
&gt;&gt; HIGHLIGHTS THE VAST

00:05:21.567 --> 00:05:24.336
DIFFERENCE BETWEEN WHAT WAS IT

00:05:23.669 --> 00:05:27.506
LIKE 20 YEARS AGO OR TODAY.

00:05:24.469 --> 00:05:29.741
IN THE INTERVIEW, HE SUCCUMBED

00:05:27.639 --> 00:05:31.610
TO BEING THE VICTIM AND FEELING

00:05:29.875 --> 00:05:34.646
VICTIMIZED.

00:05:31.743 --> 00:05:35.013
&gt;&gt; Laura: VICTIMIZED, KATHLEEN

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:38.483
KATHLEEN.

00:05:35.147 --> 00:05:39.084
&gt;&gt; HE LEFT THE WHITE HOUSE

00:05:38.617 --> 00:05:40.519
$16 MILLION IN DEBT?

00:05:39.218 --> 00:05:41.820
LET ME TELL YOU WHAT BEING IN

00:05:40.652 --> 00:05:43.755
DEBT IS LIGHT AND NOT BEING ABLE

00:05:41.954 --> 00:05:45.524
TO GET A MEANINGFUL JOB AFTER

00:05:43.889 --> 00:05:46.225
BEING THROUGH ALL OF THAT.

00:05:45.657 --> 00:05:50.963
HE HIRED ALL THESE WOMEN WHO

00:05:46.358 --> 00:05:53.332
WORKED IN HIS OFFICE AND HAS A

00:05:51.096 --> 00:05:55.067
SEXUAL HARASSMENT POLICY.

00:05:53.465 --> 00:05:58.503
HE HAD A LOT OF WOMEN AROUND SO

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.136
HE COULD, YOU KNOW, ASSAULT THEM

00:05:58.136 --> 00:05:59.538
HE COULD, YOU KNOW, ASSAULT THE

00:05:58.637 --> 00:06:01.306
THEM.

00:05:59.671 --> 00:06:01.840
THERE IS NO SEXUAL HARASSMENT

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:03.075
POLICY IN ARKANSAS.

00:06:01.974 --> 00:06:06.678
THERE NEVER WAS ONE.

00:06:06.078 --> 00:06:09.815
&gt;&gt; Laura: KATHLEEN, IF HE HAD

00:06:06.812 --> 00:06:11.016
CALLED YOU TODAY AND SAID, LOOK,

00:06:09.948 --> 00:06:13.185
I KNOW IT CAME UP BAD IN THE

00:06:11.149 --> 00:06:14.586
INTERVIEW, BUT I'M REALLY SORRY

00:06:13.318 --> 00:06:17.522
FOR CAUSING YOU PAIN, SORRY FOR

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:18.357
WHAT I DID, WOULD YOU ACCEPT HIS

00:06:17.656 --> 00:06:18.824
APOLOGY?

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:20.759
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:06:18.957 --> 00:06:22.694
I TELL THEM THE SAME THING THAT

00:06:20.893 --> 00:06:23.996
JUANITA TOLD HIM.

00:06:22.828 --> 00:06:27.099
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHICH WOULD BE...

00:06:24.129 --> 00:06:28.700
&gt;&gt; I WOULD TELL HIM TO GO TO

00:06:27.232 --> 00:06:30.502
HELL.

00:06:28.834 --> 00:06:30.869
&gt;&gt; Laura: JUANITA, SAME

00:06:30.636 --> 00:06:32.504
QUESTION.

00:06:31.003 --> 00:06:33.138
EVERYBODY CAN BE REDEEMED,

00:06:32.638 --> 00:06:34.673
RIGHT?

00:06:33.272 --> 00:06:35.240
WE ARE SUPPOSED TO BELIEVE IN

00:06:34.806 --> 00:06:36.742
REDEMPTION, ALL OF US.

00:06:35.374 --> 00:06:39.144
MOST OF US DO.

00:06:36.875 --> 00:06:39.878
&gt;&gt; I DON'T BELIEVE -- I DON'T

00:06:39.278 --> 00:06:40.946
BELIEVE THERE'S ANY REDEMPTION

00:06:40.012 --> 00:06:41.413
IN REGARD TO BILL AND

00:06:41.079 --> 00:06:43.415
HILLARY CLINTON.

00:06:41.546 --> 00:06:44.650
I DO NOT BELIEVE THAT.

00:06:43.548 --> 00:06:47.119
I WOULD PROBABLY TELL HIM THE

00:06:44.783 --> 00:06:48.754
SAME THING AGAIN TODAY.

00:06:47.252 --> 00:06:49.721
&gt;&gt; Laura: ALL RIGHT.

